# Boot with no input: Capcom logo, opening movie, title screen, then the
# attract demo (Capcom's own recorded input reel, seeded with srand(0)).
# Covers FMV playback, the title screen and the first 3D room load.
#
# Frames are main-loop frames of the virtual 30 fps clock (docs/TESTING.md).

200   capture capcom_logo.png
600   capture title.png
600   expect room == 0
3000  capture demo_room.png
3000  dump demo_room.json
3000  expect stage == 0
3000  expect room == 7
3001  quit
